--- !u!114 &5600653324547777371
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7323459986092126808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 996a26ab9cb13e24badb233277d407b9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  objectHighlighted: {fileID: 0}
  interactibleName: 
  continueText: Continue
  texts:
  - text: Do you sometimes have difficulties completing your work?
    jumpTo: 0
    taskToComplete: {fileID: 0}
    headMovementOption: 1
    options:
    - text: Yes
      jumpTo: -1
      pointsToAward: 0
    - text: No
      jumpTo: 3
      pointsToAward: 0
  - text: It is normal to feel unmotivated at times while doing your work
    jumpTo: -1
    taskToComplete: {fileID: 0}
    headMovementOption: 0
    options: []
  - text: However, for someone with mental health difficulties, they might experience
      a greater drop in motivation and energy levels for longer periods.
    jumpTo: 5
    taskToComplete: {fileID: 0}
    headMovementOption: 0
    options: []
  - text: "Good job on keeping up then! When a young person is not attending school
      or not doing well at school, they might be viewed as \u201Clazy\u201D or \u201Cunmotivated\u201D."
    jumpTo: -1
    taskToComplete: {fileID: 0}
    headMovementOption: 0
    options: []
  - text: While you might not have experienced many difficulties completing your
      work, however, someone with mental health difficulties might experience a greater
      drop in motivation and energy levels, preventing them from completing their
      work.
    jumpTo: -1
    taskToComplete: {fileID: 0}
    headMovementOption: 0
    options: []
